# Purpose
Stable reference docs for public vocabulary and safety rules.

# Key Files
- `greatvibe-example-prompts.md` (generated block between gv:examples markers; edit only around it)
- `glossary.md`
- `public-safety-rules.md`
- `dashboard-console-elements.md`
- `connector-template-types.md`
- `plans-and-pricing.md` — the only public source for prices and trial terms.

# Dependencies
- `../SANITIZATION.md` for publication rules.

# Gotchas
- Keep definitions short and public-safe.

